# SAS datasets are not published from this repository. The code lists and the
# data dictionary are the record of what was used; see docs/code-lists.md and
# docs/data-dictionary.md.
*.sas7bdat

# The generators that build docs/ from the source workbooks are internal. They
# stay on disk so a rebuild still works, but they are not published: they
# describe the internal workbooks and how their contents are corrected on the
# way out, which is program detail rather than part of the public record.
tools/

# The source workbooks the build reads are internal and are not published. Keep
# them in docs/ so tools/build-all.ps1 runs, but never commit them:
# Medical_names_and_codes.xlsx carries an opioid NDC list that is deliberately
# excluded from code-lists.csv, and committing the workbook would republish it.
docs/Data Dictionary.xlsx
docs/Medical_names_and_codes.xlsx
docs/Disease modifying medications NDCs.xlsx

# Excel lock files, created while a workbook is open
~$*

# Editor and session leftovers
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
